      "created_at": "2021-06-01T14:07:13.461Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The fates have aligned and this is brought to you on that special Same Age Day for Christopher and Adam.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/same-age-day-sode-2021\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2195fb0b2700b1df502aa120a68af896730a6609.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/same-age-day-sode-2021\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Same-Age-Day-Sode 2021!</a></h3>\n\n<p>It's International, Intergalactic, Mega-Meta-Multiversal Same-Age-Day! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:26:56 What a strange and different episode we're having today! Do we have a plan? Only slightly! We spend some retrospective time, and then move on to a...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
