      "username": "Dil_Ninja",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dil_ninja/{size}/5218_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-06-02T18:29:59.353Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I have no idea when those terms actually came around. Though given how patriarchal they are and how little they apply to real wolves, I always thought they were very old.</p>\n<p>Also, knowing the actual mascot for Felicia’s college now, the contrast is pretty amusing. We could’ve gotten a giant mutant thresher shark as a villain, and instead we get a mutant squirrel mascot named Franklin, and the squirrel is way scarier to imagine.</p>",
