    {
      "id": 238101,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-06-02T23:02:47.537Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Dil_Ninja\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"28568\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dil_ninja/48/5218_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Dil_Ninja:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>giant mutant thresher shark</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>O-oh.</p>\n<p>The whole time, I was thinking of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brown_thrasher\">similarly-named bird</a>. &gt;.&lt; Though interestingly, that search led to find a team actually named the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clearwater_Threshers\">Thrashers</a>, so that’s neat. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>And like, half the problems that were pointed out about that episode can be ameliorated through AP classes and other such things. High schools and colleges cross over all the time. :B</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-06-02T23:02:47.537Z",
